# Build-time, non-secret configuration for `vite` (dev server). Every VITE_* value ships in the bundle by design
# (R-CFG-012). Never put a secret here. The API origin is baked in at build time (R-BLD-012).
# VITE_CSP is the document policy for the templated meta tag; vite.config.ts adds frame-ancestors to the header copy
# (ADR-060). 'unsafe-inline' in script-src and style-src is the dev-server carve-out only (REJ-060).
VITE_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080
VITE_CSP="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self' ${VITE_API_ORIGIN}; img-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"
